To start the front-end:

    $ lb-steve-frontend start

To start a worker:

    $ lb-steve-worker --incoming https://sqs.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/297794765570/martin-steve-jobs \
                      --outgoing https://sqs.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/297794765570/martin-steve-jobs-status

To upload a job implementation:

    $ lb-steve-client upload-impl --impl total-v1 -i ~/total.tar.gz

To run a job:

    $ lb-steve-client create-job \
        --impl total-v1 \
        -i s3://steve-jobs/data/total/input/data.txt \
        -o s3://steve-jobs/data/total/output
